    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is the story of this game? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a rumor that there is a monster called Goat Stand. At first, people thought it was just a Goat that could stand and walk on two feet, not much different from other goats, until people kept disappearing because of it...... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> What is the gameplay of this game? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first person horror game that combines elements of horror and comedy. In the game, you need to gather clues and find a way to lift the curse and safely escape from Goat Stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes chase battles and various puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains some hidden exploration elements, some of which can affect the ending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> How many endings are there in this game? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains 3 endings, which are triggered by meeting certain conditions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The screenshot of the game is as follows\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/7a034c7910165ba4f9d19aeb98ab6d30.avif?t=1752955094\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/e1db42f88ae1897a3b680a58f0545af3.avif?t=1752955094\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/ca4592d44c168e0c3923b7e9595d1fdd.avif?t=1752955094\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/0d511b4794657dcf0def657ea8fc65d7.avif?t=1752955094\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/3cedafac363fd12ce14bcea676cdb737.avif?t=1752955094\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
